       pamsplit - split a multi-image Netpbm file into single-image files


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppaammsspplliitt

       [_n_e_t_p_b_m_f_i_l_e

       [ _o_u_t_p_u_t___f_i_l_e___p_a_t_t_e_r_n]]

       [--ppaaddnnaammee==_n]

